appropriate purposes.Their generative abilities, combined with the broad scale of deployment, contribute to a distinct and potentially wide risk profile.These features have led to an urgent call to action on generative AI, including amongst leading AI industry experts.In recent months, the international community has taken steps toward helping make these systems safer and more trustworthy.For example, the G7 recently launched the Hiroshima AI Process to coordinate discussions on generative AI risks, and in July 2023, U.S. President Joe Biden announced eight voluntary commitments from large AI companies in support of safety, security, and trust.","idx":14,"match_words":["have","many","generative ai","system","tool","also","use","malicious","inappropriate","purpose","generative","the broad scale","deployment","a distinct and potentially wide risk profile","have","an urgent call","generative","include","expert","the international community","have","take","step","make","system","safe","more","example","the g7","the hiroshima ai process","generative","risk","u.s. president joe biden","voluntary","commitment","support","safety","trust"],"words":["while","they","have","many","benefit","generative ai","system","be","powerful","tool","that","can","also","be","use","for","malicious","or","inappropriate","purpose","their","generative","ability","combine","with","the broad scale","of","deployment","contribute","to","a distinct and potentially wide risk profile","these","feature","have","lead","to","an urgent call","to","action","on","generative","ai","include","amongst","lead","ai","industry","expert","in","recent","month","the international community","have","take","step","toward","help","make","these","system","safe","and","more","trustworthy","for","example","the g7","recently","launch","the hiroshima ai process","to","coordinate","discussion","on","generative","ai","risk","and","in","july","u.s. president joe biden","announce","voluntary","commitment","from","large","ai","c