,["on","ADP",""],["considerable","ADJ",""],["feedback","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["ensure","VERB",""],["this","DET",""],["bill","NOUN",""],["is","AUX","be"],["fit","ADJ",""],["for","ADP",""],["purpose","NOUN",""],["in","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["emerging","VERB","emerge"],["and","CCONJ",""],["evolving","VERB","evolve"],["reality","NOUN",""],null],"text":"Canada has already taken significant steps toward ensuring that this technology evolves in a safe manner.Canada is well positioned to address the potential risks of AI systems through the Artificial Intelligence and Data Act (AIDA), which was tabled as part of Bill C-27 in June 2022.AIDA was designed to be adaptable to new developments in AI technologies and provides the legal foundation for the Government of Canada to regulate AI systems, including generative AI systems.The Government has heard and will continue to act on considerable feedback to ensure this bill is fit for purpose in this emerging and evolving reality.","idx":15,"match_words":["canada","have","take","step","ensure","this technology","a safe manner","canada","well","address","potential","risk","system","through","the artificial intelligence and data act","aida","bill c-27","aida","development","technology","provide","the legal foundation","the government","canada","system","include","generative","system","the government","have","act","considerable feedback","ensure","this bill","purpose"],"words":["canada","have","already","take","significant","step","toward","ensure","that","this technology","evolve","in","a safe manner","canada","be","well","positioned","to","address","the","potential","risk","of","ai","system","through","the artificial intelligence and data act","aida","which","be","table","as","part","of","bill c-27","in","june","aida","be","design","to","be","adaptable","to","new","development","in","ai","technology","and","provide","the legal foundation","for","the government","of","canada","to","regulate","ai","system","include","genera