ems","NOUN","system"],["are","AUX","be"],["able","ADJ",""],["to","PART",""],["avoid","VERB",""],["harmful","ADJ",""],["impacts","NOUN","impact"],null,["build","VERB",""],["trust","NOUN",""],["in","ADP",""],["their","PRON",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],null,["and","CCONJ",""],["transition","NOUN",""],["smoothly","ADV",""],["to","ADP",""],["compliance","NOUN",""],["with","ADP",""],["canada","PROPN",""],["'s","PART",""],["forthcoming","ADJ",""],["regulatory","ADJ",""],["regime","NOUN",""],null,["the","DET","the"],["code","NOUN",""],["will","AUX",""],["also","ADV",""],["serve","VERB",""],["to","PART",""],["reinforce","VERB",""],["canada","PROPN",""],["'s","PART",""],["contributions","NOUN","contribution"],["to","ADP",""],["active","ADJ",""],["international","ADJ",""],["deliberations","NOUN","deliberation"],["on","ADP",""],["proposals","NOUN","proposal"],["to","PART",""],["address","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["risks","NOUN","risk"],["of","ADP",""],["generative","ADJ",""],["ai","PROPN",""],null,["including","VERB","include"],["at","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["g7","NOUN","g7"],["and","CCONJ",""],["amongst","ADP",""],["like","ADJ",""],null,["minded","ADJ",""],["partners","NOUN","partner"],null],"text":"Given the urgent need and broad support for guardrails, the Government of Canada intends to prioritize the regulation of generative AI systems should AIDA receive royal assent.In the interim, the Government is committed to developing a code of practice, which would be implemented on a voluntary basis by Canadian firms ahead of the coming into force of AIDA.It is intended that this code will be sufficiently robust to ensure that developers, deployers, and operators of generative AI systems are able to avoid harmful impacts, build trust in their systems, and transition smoothly to compliance with Canada's forthcoming regulatory regime.The code will also serve to reinforce Canada's contributions to active international deliberations on proposals to address the risks of generative AI, including at the G7 and amongst like-minded partners.","idx":16,"match_words":["the urgent need","broad support","the government","canada","intend","the regulation","generative ai","system","aida","royal assent","the interim","the government","commit","develop","a code","practice","implement","a voluntary basis","firm","aida","intend","this code","ensure","developer","deployer","operator","generative","system","avoid","harmful","impact","trust","system","canada","the code","also","canada","address","risk","generative","include","the g7"],"words":["give","the urgent need","and","broad support","for","guardrail","the government","of","canada","intend","to","prioritize","the regulation","of","generative ai","system","should","aida","receive","royal assent","in","the interim","the government","be","commit","to","develop","a code","of","practice","which","would","be","implement","on","a voluntary basis","by","canadian","firm","ahead","of","the","come","into","force","of","aida","it","be","intend","that","this code","will","be","sufficiently","robust","to","ensure","that","developer","deployer","and","operator","of","generative","ai","system","be","able","to","avoid","harmful","impact","build","trust","in","their","system","and","transition","smoothly","to","compliance","with","canada","'s","forthcoming","regulatory","regime","the code","will","also","serve","to","reinforce","canada","'s","contribution","to","active","international","deliberation","on","proposal","to","address","the","risk","of","generative","ai","include","at","the g7","and","amongst","like","minded","partner"],"unmatched_count":77,"match_length":42,"cut_length":119},{"key":"18","text_words":[["code","PROPN",""],["of","ADP",""],["practice","PROPN",""],["–","PUNCT",""],["elements","NOUN","element"]],"text":"Code of Practice – Elements","idx":17,"match_words":["code","practice","element"],"words":["code","of","practice","element"],"unmatched_count":1,"match_length":3,"cut_length":4},{"key":"19","t