ts received to date from a broad cross-section of stakeholders, the Government is seeking comment on the following potential elements of a code of practice for generative AI systems—for consideration and validation through a summer 2023 engagement process.This process will include a series of virtual and hybrid roundtables, as well as expert review through the Government of Canada's AI Advisory Council.","idx":18,"match_words":["the tabling","bill c-27","the government","have","aida","base","a broad cross","the government","follow","potential","element","a code","practice","generative","system","through","process","this process","include","a series","well","expert review","through","the government","canada"],"words":["since","the tabling","of","bill c-27","in","june","the government","have","engage","extensively","with","stakeholder","on","aida","base","on","the","input","receive","to","date","from","a broad cross","section","of","stakeholder","the government","be","seek","comment","on","the","follow","potential","element","of","a code","of","practice","for","generative","ai","system","for","consideration","and","validation","through","a","summer","engagement","process","this process","will","include","a series","of","virtual","and","hybrid","roundtable","as","well","as","expert review","through","the government","of","canada","'s","ai","advisory","council"],"unmatched_count":48,"match_length":25,"cut_length":73},{"key":"21","text_words":[["safety","NOUN","safety"],["must","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["considered","VERB","consider"],["holistically","ADV",""],["throughout","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["system","NOUN",""],["'s","PART",""],["lifecycle","NOUN",""],null,["with","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],["broad","ADJ",""],["view","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["potential","ADJ",""],["impacts","NOUN","impact"],null,["particularly","ADV",""],["with","ADP",""],["regard","NOUN",""],["to","ADP",""],["misuse","NOUN",""],null,["given","VERB","give"],["the","DET",""],["wide","ADJ",""],