"],null,["fine","ADJ",""],null,["tuning","NOUN",""],null,null],"text":"implement mechanisms to allow adverse impacts to be identified and reported after the system is made available (e.g., maintaining an incident database), and commit to routine updates of models based on findings (e.g., fine-tuning).","idx":41,"match_words":["implement","mechanism","adverse","impact","identify","the system","make","available","e.g.","an incident database","commit","model","base","e.g."],"words":["implement","mechanism","to","allow","adverse","impact","to","be","identify","and","report","after","the system","be","make","available","e.g.","maintain","an incident database","and","commit","to","routine","update","of","model","base","on","finding","e.g.","fine","tuning"],"unmatched_count":18,"match_length":14,"cut_length":32},{"key":"46","text_words":[["ensuring","VERB","ensure"],["that","SCONJ",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["work","NOUN",""],["as","SCONJ",""],["intended","VERB","intend"],["and","CCONJ",""],["are","AUX","be"],["resilient","ADJ",""],["across","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["range","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["contexts","NOUN","context"],["to","PART",""],["which","PRON",""],["they","PRON",""],["are","AUX","be"],["likely","ADJ",""],["to","PART",""],["be","AUX",""],["exposed","VERB","expose"],["is","AUX","be"],["critical","ADJ",""],["to","ADP",""],["building","VERB","build"],["trust","NOUN",""],null,["this","PRON","this"],["is","AUX","be"],["a","DET",""],["particular","ADJ",""],["challenge","NOUN",""],["for","ADP",""],["widely","ADV",""],["deployed","VERB","deploy"],["generative","ADJ",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],null,["since","SCONJ",""],["they","PRON",""],["may","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["used","VERB","use"],["in","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],["broad","ADJ",""],["range","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["contexts","NOUN","context"],["and","CCONJ",""],["thus","ADV",""],["may","AUX",""],["have","VERB",""],["greater","ADJ","great"],["exposure","NOUN",""],["to","ADP",""],["misuse","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["attacks","NOUN","attack"],null,["this","DET","this"],["flexibility","NOUN",""],["is","AUX","be"],["a","DET",""],["key","ADJ",""],["advantage","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["technology","NOUN",""],null,["but","CCONJ",""],["requires","VERB","require"],["rigorous","ADJ",""],["measures","NOUN","measure"],["and","CCONJ",""],["testing","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["be","AUX",""],["put","VERB",""],["in","ADP",""],["place","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["avoid","VERB",""],["misuse","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["unintended","ADJ",""],["consequences","NOUN","consequence"],null],"text":"Ensuring that AI systems work as intended and are resilient across the range of contexts to which they are likely to be exposed is critical to building trust.This is a particular challenge for widely deployed generative AI systems, since they may be used in a broad range of contexts and thus may have greater exposure to misuse and attacks.This flexibility is a key advantage of the technology, but requires rigorous measures and testing to be put in place to avoid misuse and unintended consequences.","idx":42,"match_words":["ensure","system","work","intend","the range","context","trust","a particular challenge","widely","deploy","generative","system","use","a broad range","context","have","misuse","attack","this flexibility","a key advantage","the technology","measure","testing","put","place","avoid","misuse"],"words":["ensure","that","ai","system","work","as","intend","and","be","resilient","across","the range","of","context","to","which","they","be","likely","to","be","expose","be","critical","to","build","trust","this","be","a particular challenge","for","widely","deploy","generative","ai","system","since","they","may","be","use","in","a broad range","of","context","and","thus","may","have","great","exposure","to","misuse","and","attack","this flexibility","be","a key advantage","of","the technology","but","require","rigorous","measure","and","testing","to","be","put","in","place","to","avoid","misuse","and","unintended","consequence"],"unmatched_count":50,"match_length":27,"cut_length":77},{"key":"47","text_words":[["developers","NOUN","developer"],["of","ADP",""],["generative","ADJ",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["would","AUX",""],[":","PUNCT",""]],"text":"Developers of generative AI systems would:","idx":43,"match_words":["developer","generative","system"],"words":["developer","of","generative","ai","system","would"],"unmatched_count":3,"match_length":3,"cut_length":6},{"key":"48","text_words":[["use","VERB",""],["a","DET",""],["wide","ADJ",""],["variety","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["testing","NOUN",""],["methods","NOUN","method"],["across","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],["spectrum","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["tasks","NOUN","task"],["and","CCONJ",""],["contexts","NOUN","context"],null,["including","VERB","include"],["adversarial","ADJ",""],["testing","NOUN",""],null,["e.g.","ADV",""],null,["red","ADJ",""],null,["teaming","NOUN",""],null,null,["to","PART",""],["measure","VERB",""],["performance","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["identify","VERB",""],["vulnerabilities","NOUN","vulnerability"],null],"text":"use a wide variety of testing methods across a spectrum of tasks and contexts, including adversarial testing (e.g., red-teaming), to measure performance and identify vulnerabilities.","idx":44,"match_words":["use","a wide variety","testing","a spectrum","task","context","include","adversarial testing","e.g.","measure","identify"],"words":["use","a wide variety","of","testing","method","across","a spectrum","of","task","and","context","include","adversarial testing","e.g.","red","teaming","to","measure","performance","and","identify","vulnerability"],"unmatched_count":11,"match_length":11,"cut_length":22},{"key":"49","text_words":[["developers","NOUN","developer"],null,["deployers","NOUN","deployer"],null,["and","CCONJ",""],["operators","NOUN","operator"],["of","ADP",""],["generative","ADJ",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["would","AUX",""],[":","PUNCT",""]],"text":"Developers, deployers, and operators of generative AI systems would:","idx":45,"match_words":["developer","deployer","operator","generative","system"],"words":["developer","deployer","and","operator","of","generative","ai","system","would"],"unmatched_count":4,"match_length":5,"cut_length":9},{"key":"50","text_words":[["employ","VERB",""],["appropriate","ADJ",""],["cybersecurity","NOUN",""],["measures","NOUN","measure"],["to","PART",""],["prevent","VERB",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["identify","VERB",""],["adversarial","ADJ",""],["attacks","NOUN","attack"],["on","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["system","NOUN",""],null,["e.g.","ADV",""],null,["data","NOUN",""],["poisoning","NOUN",""],null,null],"text":"employ appropriate cybersecurity measures to prevent or identify adversarial attacks on the system (e.g., data poisoning).","idx":46,"match_words":["appropriate","measure","prevent","identify","attack","the system","e.g.","data poisoning"],"words":["employ","appropriate","cybersecurity","measure","to","prevent","or","identify","adversarial","attack","on","the system","e.g.","data poisoning"],"unmatched_count":6,"match_length":8,"cut_length":14},{"key":"52","text_words":[["generative","PROPN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["are","AUX","be"],["powerful","ADJ",""],["tools","NOUN","tool"],["with","ADP",""],["broad","ADJ",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["complex","ADJ",""],["risk","NOUN",""],["profiles","NOUN","profile"],null,["while","SCONJ","while"],["internal","ADJ",""],["governance","NOUN",""],["mechanisms","NOUN","mechanism"],["are","AUX","be"],["important","ADJ",""],["to","ADP",""],["any","DET",""],["organization","NOUN",""],["developing","VERB","develop"],null,["deploying","VERB","deploy"],null,["or","CCONJ",""],["operating","VERB","operate"],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],null,["particular","ADJ",""],["care","NOUN",""],["needs","VERB","need"],["to","PART",""],["be","AUX",""],["taken","VERB","take"],["with","ADP",""],["generative","ADJ",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["to","PART",""],["ensure","VERB",""],["that","SCONJ",""],["a","DET",""],["comprehensive","ADJ",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["multifaceted","ADJ",""],["risk","NOUN",""],["management","NOUN",""],["process","NOUN",""],["is","AUX","be"],["followed","VERB","follow"],null,["and","CCONJ",""],["that","SCONJ",""],["employees","NOUN","employee"],["across","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["value","NOUN",""],["chain","NOUN",""],["understand","VERB",""],["their","PRON",""],["role","NOUN",""],["in","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["process","NOUN",""],null],"text":"Generative AI systems are powerful tools with broad and complex risk profiles.While internal governance mechanisms are important to any organization developing, deploying, or operating AI systems, particular care needs to be taken with generative AI systems to ensure that a comprehensive and multifaceted risk management process is followed, and that employees across the AI value chain understand their role in this process.","idx":47,"match_words":["generative","system","tool","broad","risk","profile","mechanism","important","any organization","develop","deploy","system","particular care","need","take","generative","system","ensure","a comprehensive and multifaceted risk management process","follow","the ai value chain","understand","their role","this process"],"words":["generative","ai","system","be","powerful","tool","with","broad","and","complex","risk","profile","while","internal","governance","mechanism","be","important","to","any organization","develop","deploy","or","operate","ai","system","particular care","need","to","be","take","with","generative","ai","system","to","ensure","that","a comprehensive and multifaceted risk management process","be","follow","and","that","employee","across","the ai value chain","understand","their role","in","thi